  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Sierra Leone&#xbf;s National Reintegration and Referral System (NRRS-SL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the &lt;/span&gt;project is to &lt;strong&gt;foster effective migration management in Sierra Leone by enhancing institutional capacities &lt;/strong&gt;to promote integrated and holistic approach to sustainable reintegration which addresses migrants needs, as part of their communities. The development of a national reintegration system shall be at the centre of the action, the ultimate goal being to gradually transition towards a sustainable nationally-owned system based on referrals and coordinated by national authorities&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
